  "id":"tx-pu-math-contest-v2-ch1-1.1-ex-09","subject":"math","l2":"函数极限与连续","l3_id":"math.calc.limit.compute","atom_id":"","book_id":"","ability_goal":"construct","item_form":"proof_outline","difficulty":"hit","question":"设f是R上的下凸函数，证明g(x)=f(x)+f(-x)在[0,+∞)上单调递增.","answer":"只要 $g(0)\\leqslant g(x_2)$ 即可." ,"ref_source":"textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2","techniques":["凸性","Jensen"],"solution":{"steps":[{"id":"s1","text":"分析 对0<x1<x2，凸性给出 $g(x_1)\\leqslant(x_1/x_2)g(x_2)+(1-x_1/x_2)g(0)$，且需证 $g(0)\\leqslant g(x_2)$."},{"id":"s2","text":"由凸性 $g(0)=2f(0)\\leqslant f(x)+f(-x)=g(x)$."},{"id":"s3","text":"对±x1分别表示为±x2与0的凸组合."},{"id":"s4","text":"相加得 $g(x_1)\\leqslant g(x_2)$."}],"final_answer":"$g(x_1)\\leqslant g(x_2)$. ","techniques_used":["凸性","Jensen"]},"cdps":[{"id":"c1","prompt":"外层/内层函数的定义域分段如何决定复合后的区间划分？","technique":"凸性","expected":"先按外层分段条件反解内层，得到自变量区间，再代入对应表达式。"},{"id":"c2","prompt":"最终显式表达式（或所求对象）的关键结构是什么？","technique":"Jensen","expected":"$g(x_1)\\leqslant g(x_2)$."}],"meta":{"source":"textbook_example","book_id":"puheping_math_contest_v2","book_title":"","book_author":"蒲和平","chapter":"","section":"1.1","example_id":"例9","page":12,"quality_basis":"source_textbook_worked_example"}}
